        "original_id": "6f328dda-ff0d-5d10-b9f9-61d22ff65559",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Shayang County, Mengzhou, Hubei Province, Henan Province, Maliang Town, Jingmen City, People's Republic of China\n- Historical entities: Quan, State of Chu\n- People: Wen Ding, Quan Wending\n\nFacts:\n- Shayang County is a county in west-central Hubei Province in the People's Republic of China.\n- Mengzhou is a county-level city in Henan Province in the People's Republic of China.\n- Quan was founded by Quan Wending, who was a son of Wen Ding.\n- Quan was founded in the area of modern-day Maliang Town in Shayang County, Jingmen City, Hubei Province.\n- The founding area of Quan was next to the area where the State of Chu later emerged.",
